  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given equation is <math><mi>d</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />On integrating, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math><br />or <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p>"
